    "Tile Size: repeat period in image coordinates",
    "3D Noise group (Animate, Pulselength, Timescale, Timeoffset, Loop Length): time variation and seamless loop",
    "Fractal group (Max Octaves, Lacunarity, Roughness, Octave Offset): octave stacking"
  ],
  "caveats": [
    "Without the fractal process the node is equivalent to wiring Perlin noise into the Slope Direction COP.",
